Legacy operations gateway
=========================

Host: fileserver-01
SSH:  2222/tcp (legacy gateway port; the standard 22 is firewalled)
Login: admin / swarmpot

Nightly maintenance (cron, runs 02:10 UTC):
  /srv/app/bin/backup.sh --dest /home/admin/backup --keep 7

Notes:
  - The gateway only fronts the internal file shares; it is not the app server.
  - The application fleet lives behind the load balancer (see deploy/config.yml).
  - Rotate the replica credentials in secrets.env after the next audit.
  - Asset tag for this host: fsvr-01-legacy
